  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "险在自古华山一条路，长空栈道悬在绝壁，脚下万丈深渊。峨眉山，金顶十方普贤金光闪闪，云海、日出、佛光、圣灯四大奇观。黄山，奇松怪石云海温泉四绝，迎客松天下闻名。泰山，五岳之首，五千年封禅。第一昆仑山，万山之祖#中国十大名山#景点#旅行",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_425471a33eb1c977_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 556.838005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘的第十到第六，从北岳衡山到南岳衡山，从中岳嵩山到长白山天池，再到庐山，哪一万六千首诗最多？朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。有人说华山呢？峨眉山呢？泰山呢？别急，今天这集就是第五道第一，一个比一个震撼。最后那个万山之祖，龙脉之祖，中国第一神山老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第五名。陕西华山在陕西渭南华阴市五岳里的溪岳，这山最绝的就一个字显。自古华山一条路，不是说着玩的千尺状，百尺峡老君离沟，光听名字，腿就软了。光显得是长空栈道，海拔两千一百六，不是你悬在南风东侧的绝壁上，全长一百一十米。七百多年前，元代华山派宗师贺志贞带着弟子在万刃绝壁上凿出石孔斜进铁桩铺上木板，修了这条路，最窄的地方只有一块木板宽，脚下就是万丈深渊。您说这是路还是拿命在走？第四名，四川峨眉山在四川乐山，中国四大佛教名山之一普贤菩萨的道场。这山最绝的是金鼎海拔三千零七十九米，顶上有一尊十方普贤像，通高四十八米，重六百六十吨。铜铸活金在阳光下，金光闪闪。金顶上还有四大奇观，云海、日出佛光，圣灯佛光最邪乎。您站在金顶上，背对着太阳，前面有云雾的时候，您的影子会投射在云上影子。外面围着一圈彩虹，您动彩虹也动，古人不懂说是佛祖显灵，其实这是光学显灵，可在金顶上看到佛光，那感觉真的像佛祖在跟您说话，您说这是山还是仙境？讲了这几个地方，我发现评论区有个事儿特别一致。好多朋友说年轻时候忙没空去，现在退休了，有空了，可不知道该先去哪座山也不知道去了。看什么腿脚不好的说，华山这样的爬不动，有没有不用爬山也能看的，带孙子孙女的说，想给孩子讲讲这些名山的来历，可自己也说不全。咱们这个年纪看景，不光是看个热闹，是想知道这山这水有什么讲究，有什么故事。可手机上刷完就忘上网，查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，又看得眼睛疼。前阵子我翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，左边一页是实景大图加一段冷知识，右边是日期记时夜，什么季节去哪座山，走哪条路，看什么风景最合适，都给你安排好了。今天翻到庐山，明天翻到峨眉山，翻到哪页，就觉得那座山在喊你能去的地方，出门前翻一翻到了地方，看的就不是石头，是故事去不了的地方。翻翻书，看看图也算去过。放茶几上孙子，孙女来了，翻两页长知识，不说，写作文都用得上，老两口晚上翻番，商量明年去哪儿，比刷手机有意思多了。我已经放下面点开就能看到，暂时走不出去，咱就把祖国装进屋里。第三名，安徽黄山在安徽黄山市天下第一奇山。这山最绝的是四样东西，奇松、怪石、云海，温泉合在一起就叫黄山四绝。您听过那句话没有？五岳归来不看山，黄山归来不看月五越够牛了吧。泰山、华山、恒山、衡山、嵩山，看完黄山五月都不用看这话谁说的？明朝旅行家，徐霞客，他爬了一辈子山。走到黄山说了这句话，迎客松长在悬崖上一千多年了，伸着胳膊像在迎接天下客。这棵树现在是全中国最有名的一棵树。黄山还有温泉，古人叫汤泉源出海拔八百五十米的紫云峰下，水质纯净，可饮可浴。您爬完山泡个温泉，您说这是山还是老天爷给中国人修的一个大园子？第二名，山东泰山在山东泰安，海拔一千五百四十五米，五岳之首，被尊为中华国山天下第一山。这山最绝的不是高，是他被中国人拜了五千年。从远古开始，泰山就被当成太阳升起之山生命大诞生之处。秦始皇统一中国以后，第一件事儿就是来泰山封禅。什么叫封禅？在山顶上助坛祭天叫风，在山脚下祭地叫禅风扇，是古代帝王最高规格的典礼，不是每个皇帝都能来得，天下太平，得有功绩。秦始皇来过汉武帝来过，汉武帝，一生来了八次，还在山顶上立了一块无字碑。唐高宗来过唐玄宗来过宋真宗来过两千多年里，先后有十三位皇帝亲登泰山封禅，或祭祀孔子来过杜甫来过杜甫，站在泰山顶上写了一句会当凌绝顶，一览众山小。司马迁写过人固有一死，或重于泰山，或轻于鸿毛。一座山跟中国人的生死观荣辱关全绑在一起了，别的山再牛，论资排辈都得往后站，可为什么泰山只排第二？因为第一名是所有山的祖宗第一名。青海、昆仑山昆仑山是亚洲最长的山脉之一，从帕米尔高原一路向东东横跨新疆、西藏。青海全长两千五百多公里，平均海拔五千五百米到六千米，它被叫做万山之祖，龙脉之祖，中国第一神山。为什么昆仑山排第一？不是因为它最高，不是因为它最美，是因为它是所有山的祖宗。在中国古代神话里，昆仑山是西王母，住的地方，是天帝，在人间的都邑，是皇帝在人间的夏都。中国的很多神话故事都从昆仑山开始，女娲补天、后羿射日、嫦娥奔月中跟昆仑山有关。更绝的是，昆仑山是中国龙脉的发源地，中国三大龙脉。北龙中龙南龙全从昆仑山发源，从昆仑山出来，一路向东，铺遍了整个中国。所有的名山都是昆仑山的子孙，泰山是华山，是黄山，是峨眉山，也是一座山，生出了全中国的山。您说这个第一名服不服？您听出来了没有？这十座名山，没有一座是光靠好看出名的。恒山靠的是北方的屏障，恒山靠的是四季的舞台。嵩山靠的是中原文脉。长白山靠的是藏在天上。庐山靠的是师，华山，靠的是险，峨眉山靠的是佛光。黄山靠的是四绝，泰山，靠的是五千年，昆仑山靠的是万山之祖，每一座名山的厉害之处都不在它有多高。在它有多厚点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 670,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00002",
      "start_ms": 670,
      "end_ms": 2670,
      "text": "咱们盘的第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3170,
      "end_ms": 5610,
      "text": "从北岳衡山到南岳衡山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6010,
      "end_ms": 8830,
      "text": "从中岳嵩山到长白山天池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9350,
      "end_ms": 10210,
      "text": "再到庐山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10210,
      "end_ms": 13270,
      "text": "哪一万六千首诗最多？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13270,
      "end_ms": 15110,
      "text": "朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15570,
      "end_ms": 17330,
      "text": "有人说华山呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17530,
      "end_ms": 18530,
      "text": "峨眉山呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18730,
      "end_ms": 19550,
      "text": "泰山呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00011",
      "start_ms": 19670,
      "end_ms": 20210,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00012",
      "start_ms": 20790,
      "end_ms": 23070,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00013",
      "start_ms": 23330,
      "end_ms": 24450,
      "text": "一个比一个震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00014",
      "start_ms": 24810,
      "end_ms": 26670,
      "text": "最后那个万山之祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00015",
      "start_ms": 26970,
      "end_ms": 27930,
      "text": "龙脉之祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00016",
      "start_ms": 28450,
      "end_ms": 33640,
      "text": "中国第一神山老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00017",
      "start_ms": 33740,
      "end_ms": 36280,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第五名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00018",
      "start_ms": 36600,
      "end_ms": 41840,
      "text": "陕西华山在陕西渭南华阴市五岳里的溪岳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00019",
      "start_ms": 42220,
      "end_ms": 45040,
      "text": "这山最绝的就一个字显。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00020",
      "start_ms": 45820,
      "end_ms": 47460,
      "text": "自古华山一条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00021",
      "start_ms": 47580,
      "end_ms": 50460,
      "text": "不是说着玩的千尺状，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00022",
      "start_ms": 50820,
      "end_ms": 52840,
      "text": "百尺峡老君离沟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00023",
      "start_ms": 53380,
      "end_ms": 54340,
      "text": "光听名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00024",
      "start_ms": 54520,
      "end_ms": 55480,
      "text": "腿就软了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00025",
      "start_ms": 56060,
      "end_ms": 58120,
      "text": "光显得是长空栈道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00026",
      "start_ms": 58420,
      "end_ms": 59945,
      "text": "海拔两千一百六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00027",
      "start_ms": 60050,
      "end_ms": 63565,
      "text": "不是你悬在南风东侧的绝壁上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00028",
      "start_ms": 64860,
      "end_ms": 66675,
      "text": "全长一百一十米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00029",
      "start_ms": 67220,
      "end_ms": 68255,
      "text": "七百多年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00030",
      "start_ms": 68710,
      "end_ms": 78050,
      "text": "元代华山派宗师贺志贞带着弟子在万刃绝壁上凿出石孔斜进铁桩铺上木板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00031",
      "start_ms": 78230,
      "end_ms": 79165,
      "text": "修了这条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00032",
      "start_ms": 80060,
      "end_ms": 82975,
      "text": "最窄的地方只有一块木板宽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00033",
      "start_ms": 83750,
      "end_ms": 85565,
      "text": "脚下就是万丈深渊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00034",
      "start_ms": 86100,
      "end_ms": 88565,
      "text": "您说这是路还是拿命在走？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00035",
      "start_ms": 89980,
      "end_ms": 90615,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00036",
      "start_ms": 90980,
      "end_ms": 93885,
      "text": "四川峨眉山在四川乐山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00037",
      "start_ms": 94190,
      "end_ms": 98015,
      "text": "中国四大佛教名山之一普贤菩萨的道场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00038",
      "start_ms": 98520,
      "end_ms": 103255,
      "text": "这山最绝的是金鼎海拔三千零七十九米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00039",
      "start_ms": 103780,
      "end_ms": 105965,
      "text": "顶上有一尊十方普贤像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00040",
      "start_ms": 106410,
      "end_ms": 107955,
      "text": "通高四十八米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00041",
      "start_ms": 108290,
      "end_ms": 109345,
      "text": "重六百六十吨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00042",
      "start_ms": 110260,
      "end_ms": 112670,
      "text": "铜铸活金在阳光下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00043",
      "start_ms": 112890,
      "end_ms": 113915,
      "text": "金光闪闪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00044",
      "start_ms": 114410,
      "end_ms": 116130,
      "text": "金顶上还有四大奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00045",
      "start_ms": 116270,
      "end_ms": 118370,
      "text": "云海、日出佛光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00046",
      "start_ms": 118670,
      "end_ms": 121670,
      "text": "圣灯佛光最邪乎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00047",
      "start_ms": 122550,
      "end_ms": 123950,
      "text": "您站在金顶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00048",
      "start_ms": 124930,
      "end_ms": 126050,
      "text": "背对着太阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00049",
      "start_ms": 127070,
      "end_ms": 128750,
      "text": "前面有云雾的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00050",
      "start_ms": 128850,
      "end_ms": 131390,
      "text": "您的影子会投射在云上影子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00051",
      "start_ms": 131390,
      "end_ms": 133590,
      "text": "外面围着一圈彩虹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00052",
      "start_ms": 133950,
      "end_ms": 135810,
      "text": "您动彩虹也动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00053",
      "start_ms": 136170,
      "end_ms": 138730,
      "text": "古人不懂说是佛祖显灵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00054",
      "start_ms": 139210,
      "end_ms": 140830,
      "text": "其实这是光学显灵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00055",
      "start_ms": 141270,
      "end_ms": 143630,
      "text": "可在金顶上看到佛光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00056",
      "start_ms": 144290,
      "end_ms": 147410,
      "text": "那感觉真的像佛祖在跟您说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00057",
      "start_ms": 147950,
      "end_ms": 150560,
      "text": "您说这是山还是仙境？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00058",
      "start_ms": 151520,
      "end_ms": 152700,
      "text": "讲了这几个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00059",
      "start_ms": 152920,
      "end_ms": 155280,
      "text": "我发现评论区有个事儿特别一致。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00060",
      "start_ms": 155360,
      "end_ms": 158080,
      "text": "好多朋友说年轻时候忙没空去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00061",
      "start_ms": 158340,
      "end_ms": 159280,
      "text": "现在退休了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00062",
      "start_ms": 159420,
      "end_ms": 160120,
      "text": "有空了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00063",
      "start_ms": 160240,
      "end_ms": 163000,
      "text": "可不知道该先去哪座山也不知道去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00064",
      "start_ms": 163000,
      "end_ms": 165500,
      "text": "看什么腿脚不好的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00065",
      "start_ms": 165840,
      "end_ms": 167420,
      "text": "华山这样的爬不动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00066",
      "start_ms": 167660,
      "end_ms": 169880,
      "text": "有没有不用爬山也能看的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00067",
      "start_ms": 170540,
      "end_ms": 171940,
      "text": "带孙子孙女的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00068",
      "start_ms": 172440,
      "end_ms": 175500,
      "text": "想给孩子讲讲这些名山的来历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00069",
      "start_ms": 175700,
      "end_ms": 176940,
      "text": "可自己也说不全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00070",
      "start_ms": 177920,
      "end_ms": 179575,
      "text": "咱们这个年纪看景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00071",
      "start_ms": 180000,
      "end_ms": 181345,
      "text": "不光是看个热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00072",
      "start_ms": 181750,
      "end_ms": 185010,
      "text": "是想知道这山这水有什么讲究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00073",
      "start_ms": 185250,
      "end_ms": 186135,
      "text": "有什么故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00074",
      "start_ms": 187060,
      "end_ms": 189390,
      "text": "可手机上刷完就忘上网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00075",
      "start_ms": 189450,
      "end_ms": 191815,
      "text": "查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00076",
      "start_ms": 192110,
      "end_ms": 193225,
      "text": "又看得眼睛疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00077",
      "start_ms": 193940,
      "end_ms": 199265,
      "text": "前阵子我翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00078",
      "start_ms": 199810,
      "end_ms": 204065,
      "text": "左边一页是实景大图加一段冷知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00079",
      "start_ms": 204590,
      "end_ms": 206465,
      "text": "右边是日期记时夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00080",
      "start_ms": 206830,
      "end_ms": 208235,
      "text": "什么季节去哪座山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00081",
      "start_ms": 208510,
      "end_ms": 209250,
      "text": "走哪条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00082",
      "start_ms": 209270,
      "end_ms": 210825,
      "text": "看什么风景最合适，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00083",
      "start_ms": 211160,
      "end_ms": 212245,
      "text": "都给你安排好了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00084",
      "start_ms": 212580,
      "end_ms": 213500,
      "text": "今天翻到庐山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00085",
      "start_ms": 213580,
      "end_ms": 214805,
      "text": "明天翻到峨眉山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00086",
      "start_ms": 215280,
      "end_ms": 216100,
      "text": "翻到哪页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00087",
      "start_ms": 216100,
      "end_ms": 219410,
      "text": "就觉得那座山在喊你能去的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00088",
      "start_ms": 219570,
      "end_ms": 221980,
      "text": "出门前翻一翻到了地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00089",
      "start_ms": 222000,
      "end_ms": 223140,
      "text": "看的就不是石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00090",
      "start_ms": 223200,
      "end_ms": 225095,
      "text": "是故事去不了的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00091",
      "start_ms": 225490,
      "end_ms": 226130,
      "text": "翻翻书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00092",
      "start_ms": 226130,
      "end_ms": 228275,
      "text": "看看图也算去过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00093",
      "start_ms": 228690,
      "end_ms": 230410,
      "text": "放茶几上孙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00094",
      "start_ms": 230410,
      "end_ms": 231050,
      "text": "孙女来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00095",
      "start_ms": 231050,
      "end_ms": 232760,
      "text": "翻两页长知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00096",
      "start_ms": 232760,
      "end_ms": 233155,
      "text": "不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00097",
      "start_ms": 233520,
      "end_ms": 234765,
      "text": "写作文都用得上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00098",
      "start_ms": 235140,
      "end_ms": 236495,
      "text": "老两口晚上翻番，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00099",
      "start_ms": 236930,
      "end_ms": 238315,
      "text": "商量明年去哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00100",
      "start_ms": 238500,
      "end_ms": 240125,
      "text": "比刷手机有意思多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00101",
      "start_ms": 240450,
      "end_ms": 243455,
      "text": "我已经放下面点开就能看到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00102",
      "start_ms": 243910,
      "end_ms": 245395,
      "text": "暂时走不出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00103",
      "start_ms": 245850,
      "end_ms": 247465,
      "text": "咱就把祖国装进屋里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00104",
      "start_ms": 249100,
      "end_ms": 249765,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00105",
      "start_ms": 250380,
      "end_ms": 255755,
      "text": "安徽黄山在安徽黄山市天下第一奇山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00106",
      "start_ms": 256560,
      "end_ms": 259865,
      "text": "这山最绝的是四样东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00107",
      "start_ms": 261460,
      "end_ms": 263810,
      "text": "奇松、怪石、云海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00108",
      "start_ms": 264030,
      "end_ms": 267225,
      "text": "温泉合在一起就叫黄山四绝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00109",
      "start_ms": 268160,
      "end_ms": 269505,
      "text": "您听过那句话没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00110",
      "start_ms": 269800,
      "end_ms": 271675,
      "text": "五岳归来不看山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00111",
      "start_ms": 272200,
      "end_ms": 275705,
      "text": "黄山归来不看月五越够牛了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00112",
      "start_ms": 277210,
      "end_ms": 280905,
      "text": "泰山、华山、恒山、衡山、嵩山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00113",
      "start_ms": 281850,
      "end_ms": 286495,
      "text": "看完黄山五月都不用看这话谁说的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00114",
      "start_ms": 287430,
      "end_ms": 288565,
      "text": "明朝旅行家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00115",
      "start_ms": 288850,
      "end_ms": 289675,
      "text": "徐霞客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00116",
      "start_ms": 290580,
      "end_ms": 291755,
      "text": "他爬了一辈子山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00117",
      "start_ms": 292770,
      "end_ms": 294850,
      "text": "走到黄山说了这句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00118",
      "start_ms": 295250,
      "end_ms": 299050,
      "text": "迎客松长在悬崖上一千多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00119",
      "start_ms": 299450,
      "end_ms": 302510,
      "text": "伸着胳膊像在迎接天下客。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00120",
      "start_ms": 303090,
      "end_ms": 307370,
      "text": "这棵树现在是全中国最有名的一棵树。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00121",
      "start_ms": 307510,
      "end_ms": 308850,
      "text": "黄山还有温泉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00122",
      "start_ms": 309450,
      "end_ms": 314530,
      "text": "古人叫汤泉源出海拔八百五十米的紫云峰下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00123",
      "start_ms": 315030,
      "end_ms": 316210,
      "text": "水质纯净，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00124",
      "start_ms": 316670,
      "end_ms": 317770,
      "text": "可饮可浴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00125",
      "start_ms": 318290,
      "end_ms": 320470,
      "text": "您爬完山泡个温泉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00126",
      "start_ms": 321070,
      "end_ms": 326720,
      "text": "您说这是山还是老天爷给中国人修的一个大园子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00127",
      "start_ms": 327680,
      "end_ms": 328340,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00128",
      "start_ms": 328680,
      "end_ms": 331920,
      "text": "山东泰山在山东泰安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00129",
      "start_ms": 332240,
      "end_ms": 335040,
      "text": "海拔一千五百四十五米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00130",
      "start_ms": 336280,
      "end_ms": 337140,
      "text": "五岳之首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00131",
      "start_ms": 337340,
      "end_ms": 340600,
      "text": "被尊为中华国山天下第一山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00132",
      "start_ms": 340840,
      "end_ms": 343120,
      "text": "这山最绝的不是高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00133",
      "start_ms": 343520,
      "end_ms": 346100,
      "text": "是他被中国人拜了五千年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00134",
      "start_ms": 346620,
      "end_ms": 347840,
      "text": "从远古开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00135",
      "start_ms": 348360,
      "end_ms": 353455,
      "text": "泰山就被当成太阳升起之山生命大诞生之处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00136",
      "start_ms": 354340,
      "end_ms": 356425,
      "text": "秦始皇统一中国以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00137",
      "start_ms": 356830,
      "end_ms": 359565,
      "text": "第一件事儿就是来泰山封禅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00138",
      "start_ms": 360580,
      "end_ms": 361555,
      "text": "什么叫封禅？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00139",
      "start_ms": 362020,
      "end_ms": 365950,
      "text": "在山顶上助坛祭天叫风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00140",
      "start_ms": 366270,
      "end_ms": 369675,
      "text": "在山脚下祭地叫禅风扇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00141",
      "start_ms": 370080,
      "end_ms": 373115,
      "text": "是古代帝王最高规格的典礼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00142",
      "start_ms": 373590,
      "end_ms": 376310,
      "text": "不是每个皇帝都能来得，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00143",
      "start_ms": 376310,
      "end_ms": 377425,
      "text": "天下太平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00144",
      "start_ms": 377790,
      "end_ms": 378695,
      "text": "得有功绩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00145",
      "start_ms": 379490,
      "end_ms": 382030,
      "text": "秦始皇来过汉武帝来过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00146",
      "start_ms": 382390,
      "end_ms": 382950,
      "text": "汉武帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00147",
      "start_ms": 382950,
      "end_ms": 384595,
      "text": "一生来了八次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00148",
      "start_ms": 385210,
      "end_ms": 387455,
      "text": "还在山顶上立了一块无字碑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00149",
      "start_ms": 388250,
      "end_ms": 394910,
      "text": "唐高宗来过唐玄宗来过宋真宗来过两千多年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00150",
      "start_ms": 395090,
      "end_ms": 398415,
      "text": "先后有十三位皇帝亲登泰山封禅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00151",
      "start_ms": 398680,
      "end_ms": 402620,
      "text": "或祭祀孔子来过杜甫来过杜甫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00152",
      "start_ms": 402620,
      "end_ms": 406525,
      "text": "站在泰山顶上写了一句会当凌绝顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00153",
      "start_ms": 406820,
      "end_ms": 408145,
      "text": "一览众山小。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00154",
      "start_ms": 408790,
      "end_ms": 411555,
      "text": "司马迁写过人固有一死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00155",
      "start_ms": 411870,
      "end_ms": 413050,
      "text": "或重于泰山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00156",
      "start_ms": 413410,
      "end_ms": 414670,
      "text": "或轻于鸿毛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00157",
      "start_ms": 415130,
      "end_ms": 419930,
      "text": "一座山跟中国人的生死观荣辱关全绑在一起了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00158",
      "start_ms": 420250,
      "end_ms": 421430,
      "text": "别的山再牛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00159",
      "start_ms": 421910,
      "end_ms": 424070,
      "text": "论资排辈都得往后站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00160",
      "start_ms": 424610,
      "end_ms": 426690,
      "text": "可为什么泰山只排第二？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00161",
      "start_ms": 427510,
      "end_ms": 433470,
      "text": "因为第一名是所有山的祖宗第一名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00162",
      "start_ms": 435250,
      "end_ms": 439390,
      "text": "青海、昆仑山昆仑山是亚洲最长的山脉之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00163",
      "start_ms": 439770,
      "end_ms": 444240,
      "text": "从帕米尔高原一路向东东横跨新疆、西藏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00164",
      "start_ms": 444240,
      "end_ms": 447140,
      "text": "青海全长两千五百多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00165",
      "start_ms": 447700,
      "end_ms": 451140,
      "text": "平均海拔五千五百米到六千米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00166",
      "start_ms": 451640,
      "end_ms": 453480,
      "text": "它被叫做万山之祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00167",
      "start_ms": 453740,
      "end_ms": 454680,
      "text": "龙脉之祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00168",
      "start_ms": 455280,
      "end_ms": 456720,
      "text": "中国第一神山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00169",
      "start_ms": 457680,
      "end_ms": 459400,
      "text": "为什么昆仑山排第一？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00170",
      "start_ms": 460040,
      "end_ms": 461260,
      "text": "不是因为它最高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00171",
      "start_ms": 461920,
      "end_ms": 463240,
      "text": "不是因为它最美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00172",
      "start_ms": 463420,
      "end_ms": 465920,
      "text": "是因为它是所有山的祖宗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00173",
      "start_ms": 466480,
      "end_ms": 468260,
      "text": "在中国古代神话里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00174",
      "start_ms": 468440,
      "end_ms": 470060,
      "text": "昆仑山是西王母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00175",
      "start_ms": 470060,
      "end_ms": 470840,
      "text": "住的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00176",
      "start_ms": 471040,
      "end_ms": 472010,
      "text": "是天帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00177",
      "start_ms": 472010,
      "end_ms": 473430,
      "text": "在人间的都邑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00178",
      "start_ms": 473570,
      "end_ms": 475590,
      "text": "是皇帝在人间的夏都。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00179",
      "start_ms": 476370,
      "end_ms": 479650,
      "text": "中国的很多神话故事都从昆仑山开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00180",
      "start_ms": 480450,
      "end_ms": 486710,
      "text": "女娲补天、后羿射日、嫦娥奔月中跟昆仑山有关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00181",
      "start_ms": 487690,
      "end_ms": 488630,
      "text": "更绝的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00182",
      "start_ms": 489030,
      "end_ms": 491810,
      "text": "昆仑山是中国龙脉的发源地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00183",
      "start_ms": 492530,
      "end_ms": 493910,
      "text": "中国三大龙脉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00184",
      "start_ms": 494210,
      "end_ms": 498210,
      "text": "北龙中龙南龙全从昆仑山发源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00185",
      "start_ms": 498930,
      "end_ms": 500130,
      "text": "从昆仑山出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00186",
      "start_ms": 500330,
      "end_ms": 501050,
      "text": "一路向东，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00187",
      "start_ms": 501050,
      "end_ms": 503080,
      "text": "铺遍了整个中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00188",
      "start_ms": 503480,
      "end_ms": 506200,
      "text": "所有的名山都是昆仑山的子孙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00189",
      "start_ms": 506540,
      "end_ms": 507940,
      "text": "泰山是华山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00190",
      "start_ms": 508000,
      "end_ms": 508840,
      "text": "是黄山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00191",
      "start_ms": 508900,
      "end_ms": 510080,
      "text": "是峨眉山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00192",
      "start_ms": 510160,
      "end_ms": 511640,
      "text": "也是一座山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00193",
      "start_ms": 511860,
      "end_ms": 513920,
      "text": "生出了全中国的山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00194",
      "start_ms": 514580,
      "end_ms": 516920,
      "text": "您说这个第一名服不服？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00195",
      "start_ms": 517100,
      "end_ms": 518400,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00196",
      "start_ms": 518960,
      "end_ms": 520260,
      "text": "这十座名山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00197",
      "start_ms": 520560,
      "end_ms": 523740,
      "text": "没有一座是光靠好看出名的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00198",
      "start_ms": 523980,
      "end_ms": 526540,
      "text": "恒山靠的是北方的屏障，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00199",
      "start_ms": 527020,
      "end_ms": 529300,
      "text": "恒山靠的是四季的舞台。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00200",
      "start_ms": 529920,
      "end_ms": 532330,
      "text": "嵩山靠的是中原文脉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00201",
      "start_ms": 532890,
      "end_ms": 535130,
      "text": "长白山靠的是藏在天上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00202",
      "start_ms": 535670,
      "end_ms": 536990,
      "text": "庐山靠的是师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00203",
      "start_ms": 537590,
      "end_ms": 538130,
      "text": "华山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00204",
      "start_ms": 538230,
      "end_ms": 538970,
      "text": "靠的是险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00205",
      "start_ms": 539550,
      "end_ms": 541410,
      "text": "峨眉山靠的是佛光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00206",
      "start_ms": 542030,
      "end_ms": 543510,
      "text": "黄山靠的是四绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00207",
      "start_ms": 543910,
      "end_ms": 544410,
      "text": "泰山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00208",
      "start_ms": 544510,
      "end_ms": 545530,
      "text": "靠的是五千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00209",
      "start_ms": 545930,
      "end_ms": 548410,
      "text": "昆仑山靠的是万山之祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00210",
      "start_ms": 548870,
      "end_ms": 552590,
      "text": "每一座名山的厉害之处都不在它有多高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00211",
      "start_ms": 552830,
      "end_ms": 554930,
      "text": "在它有多厚点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_425471a33eb1c977_s00212",
      "start_ms": 555130,
      "end_ms": 556725,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
